sequenceDiagram
  %% Target design: ADR 0244 task; DECISIONS round 2 (websocket.sync: no polling step, Gateway closes the task from Reverb's own reports, R1 no run).
  %% status: draft
  autonumber
  %% lane CLI icon=terminal pill=caller tone=gray
  %% lane GW icon=gateway pill=intent tone=blue
  %% lane N icon=server pill=target tone=amber
  participant CLI as CLI / MCP<br/>orbit · MCP tools
  participant GW as Gateway<br/>Laravel API
  participant N as Reverb<br/>on websocket Node
  CLI->>GW: websocket:sync<br/>{wait: 60}
  Note over GW: Pin current registry<br/>revision 18 · R1, no run
  GW-->>CLI: 202 Accepted<br/>task #5125
  loop each Reverb reconcile, 30 s
    N->>GW: Pull the registry<br/>Reverb reconcile
    N->>GW: Report applied revision<br/>per process, epoch
  end
  alt every process applied 18
    Note over GW: Close task, succeeded<br/>backend: applied
  else stale, superseded, timeout
    Note over GW: Close task, failed<br/>websocket.registry_pending
  end
  loop every 2 s until terminal or --wait
    CLI->>GW: operation:show #5125
    GW-->>CLI: status + result
  end
